WEBVTT

00:02:59.116 --> 00:03:02.916
And I followed the rule
that we set with our friends

00:03:02.956 --> 00:03:04.556
and I called people.

00:03:04.556 --> 00:03:06.996
Because one of the things
I asked my friend is like,

00:03:07.036 --> 00:03:08.236
how do you overcome it?

00:03:08.236 --> 00:03:11.116
He said, you have to force yourself
back into a sleep pattern

00:03:11.156 --> 00:03:13.596
and force yourself to call friends
and ask for help.

00:03:13.596 --> 00:03:15.196
And so I think one of the things,

00:03:15.236 --> 00:03:17.836
I think that comes out of COVID,

00:03:17.876 --> 00:03:21.796
is we recognized just the importance
of human connection.

00:03:21.796 --> 00:03:25.236
You know, in this fast-paced
digital world,

00:03:25.236 --> 00:03:27.716
we kidded ourselves to think
that we had connections

00:03:27.716 --> 00:03:29.276
just because we were connected.

00:03:29.316 --> 00:03:31.436
But it was amazing to see
when COVID started,